{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0900_stafff_01",
      "hash": "eaf7003cf3e9b4e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "前台：你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0900_stafff_04",
      "hash": "eaf6fd3cf3e9afcb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我们公司\\n现在遇到了些麻烦。\\c\\n……因为有些危险，\\n小孩子不可以进去哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_01",
      "hash": "26e576e0f08c51d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：别这么说，\\n就让我们参观一下呗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0900_stafff_02",
      "hash": "eaf7033cf3e9b9fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "前台：啊呀！\\n是青绿啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_01",
      "hash": "4c13e9c3c6b311d4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n找你半天了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_07",
      "hash": "4c13e7c3c6b30e6e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你为什么会来这幢楼？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0900_select_01",
      "hash": "994bb0148a000904",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "因为火箭队……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0900_select_02",
      "hash": "994bb3148a000e1d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我听说这里被占领了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_02",
      "hash": "4c13ecc3c6b316ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：果然不出我所料！\\n火箭队那些家伙，\\r\\n真是走到哪儿都作恶不断！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_02",
      "hash": "26e573e0f08c4cb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：正如[VAR TRNAME(0001)]所说！\\c\\n我们不能再这么\\n放任火箭队胡作非为了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0900_select_03",
      "hash": "994bb2148a000c6a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我也这么想！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0900_select_04",
      "hash": "994bad148a0003eb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要怎么做呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_03",
      "hash": "26e574e0f08c4e6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：好吧！\\n我们赶紧制定作战计划吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_04",
      "hash": "26e579e0f08c56ea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：我们就从\\n自己力所能及的事开始做起吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_05",
      "hash": "26e57ae0f08c589d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……那就这么定了。\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]照计划，\\n去把西尔佛公司里的\\r\\n火箭队赶出去。\\c\\n一个人对付火箭队太危险，\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]也一起去吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_03",
      "hash": "4c13ebc3c6b3153a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：好的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_06",
      "hash": "26e577e0f08c5384",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：与此同时，我来负责\\n在关都地区全境搜索！\\c\\n一边把遇上的每个\\n火箭队的家伙都解决掉，\\r\\n一边想办法找到\\r\\n火箭队老大的藏身之处。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_11",
      "hash": "26e8fae0f08f67f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "然后我也会去宝可梦联盟，\\n通知他们事件的经过。"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_04",
      "hash": "4c13e6c3c6b30cbb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：帅呆了！\\n也就是说，我们或许还能\\r\\n得到四天王的帮助……！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_07",
      "hash": "26e578e0f08c5537",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：那么接下来我们就兵分两路，\\n开始实施作战计划吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_08",
      "hash": "26e56de0f08c4286",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……虽然这么说，\\n在那之前……"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_12",
      "hash": "26e8fde0f08f6d0d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]、[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！\\c\\n因为我也不清楚\\n你俩的本事到不到家，\\c\\n所以我得先见识一下你们的实力，\\n才能放心地把接下来的事交给你们！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_05",
      "hash": "4c13e5c3c6b30b08",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：什么！"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_09",
      "hash": "26e56ee0f08c4439",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：谁先来都可以，\\n就放马过来吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main0900_green_10",
      "hash": "26e8fbe0f08f69a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：喂喂！你要往哪儿走？\\n我可在这边呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_main0900_stafff_03",
      "hash": "eaf7023cf3e9b84a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "前台：你们是来\\n拯救西尔佛公司的吗？\\c\\n既然是青绿的朋友，\\n应该是可以信赖的人吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_main0900_rival_06",
      "hash": "4c13e8c3c6b31021",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：如果这次能赢，\\n或许我就能有信心\\r\\n为嘎啦嘎啦报仇了……！\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，你要先上吗？"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0900_max",
      "hash": "d4af1fd88e867b70"
    }
  ]
}
